There is a rack right near the fitting room.
There is a yellow top on it.
It is a nice bright yellow colour.
I like that yellow top.
I take it in my hand.
This is a small top.
Its size is 'small'.
I enter the room again with that top.
I put on this yellow top.
I look in the mirror.
This top is very tight.
The small size is not a fit for me.
It is not at all comfortable.
I need a large size.
I take off that yellow top.
I wear my clothes again.
I am not buying this top.
I leave it right there.
Then I come outside.
